heard a single mention of this, nor did I see it in my California Gun
Laws pamphlet (not handy now, so I can't check). Are you _sure_ about
this, Vince?

The new Brady Bill law mandates a training class, but this is some
months off. (And nobody in the gun shops I've been to thinks the
classes will be ready in time for when the new law takes effect.)

