Some semi-auto rifles will not be affected, e.g., the Ruger Mini-14
"Ranch Rifle," with scope rings, is specifically _excluded_. (Time was
when a scoped "high-power" rifle reminded folks of Charles Whitman or
Lee Harvey Oswald, and folks wanted them banned. Now a scoped rifle is
seen as nonthreatening. Until another crazy climbs a tower.)

> 2.  Moynehan(?) mega-tax:  Most ammo will be taxed at some extremely high
